Rules: Also returns all snapshot fields and template (immutable template_content). targets are active matches for dataset, period and template version. history contains recorded actions; submittedVersions contains immutable values per submit attempt. Nested history/revision models use snake_case. See snapshot field guide below.

Input example:
{
  "expectedRevision": 0,
  "values": [
    {
      "indicatorId": 8,
      "value": "20",
      "remarks": "Period-end staff",
      "breakdowns": [
