          "dimensionId": 2,
          "optionId": 4,
          "value": "8"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
Response: {data:SubmissionSnapshot}, revision increments.
Rules: PUT replaces all draft/returned rows; [] clears rows. values must be a list of objects, max10000, never a string. Each row indicatorId and value (nullable in draft); optional remarks max10000. breakdowns list max10000 uses dimensionId,optionId,value; dimensionValues max100 uses dimensionId,value for cross-tab coordinates. Do not mix summary breakdowns and cross-tab rows for one indicator. Validate IDs against submission template. Numeric decimals sent as strings (not floating point), max18 digits before decimal and6 places. Draft may save incomplete values. On submit each required/filled breakdown dimension must contain its options and sum independently to indicator total. Entirely omitted optional dimension is valid. Do not sum Staff Category plus Gender: both describe the same total. Empty previous-period values are not zero. Negative numeric values are accepted by backend. Stale expectedRevision:409; entry/correction-window violations:422.

